      "content": "That's a good start. To get a bit more specific for the design team, can we talk about the physical appearance and 'vibe' of these people? \n\nLike, when we're casting models or choosing lead faces for the campaigns, what are the typical physical traits or ethnic backgrounds that best embody that 'old money' look? And for the urban crowd, what kind of diversity or specific cultural aesthetics are we looking at to make it feel authentic?",
